# OAuth client secrets. data/ is already ignored, but Google's download lands
# in ~/Downloads under this name and it gets copied to the repo root by hand --
# which happened on 2026-08-29 and was one `git add .` away from a public repo.
# Belt and braces: match the name anywhere in the tree.
client_secret*.json
*apps.googleusercontent.com.json
gmail_credentials.json
gmail_token.json
